    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>https://seninp.github.io/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://seninp.github.io/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;about&#34;&gt;About&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;avatar&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://seninp.github.io/pavel_senin.png&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Principal scientist at &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.sanofi.com/&#34;&gt;Sanofi&lt;/a&gt;, leading the &lt;strong&gt;Physical AI team&lt;/strong&gt; — we&amp;rsquo;re teaching robots to run wet labs, turning benchwork into code. Previously: spatial transcriptomics and SaMD at Sanofi, RWE/causal inference for rare disease, computational storage at &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.westerndigital.com/&#34;&gt;Western Digital&lt;/a&gt;, and a postdoc at &lt;a href=&#34;https://lanl.gov/&#34;&gt;LANL&lt;/a&gt; on the R&amp;amp;D100-winning &lt;a href=&#34;https://edgebioinformatics.org/&#34;&gt;EDGE Bioinformatics&lt;/a&gt; platform. PhD from UH Manoa under &lt;a href=&#34;https://philipmjohnson.org/&#34;&gt;Philip M. Johnson&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My academic work spans &lt;strong&gt;life sciences&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;temporal data analysis&lt;/strong&gt;. On the life-sciences side: contributing to the &lt;a href=&#34;https://seninp.github.io/pubs#ming2008draft&#34;&gt;first transgenic plant genome — papaya&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Nature&lt;/em&gt;, 2008), and the discovery of methane oxidation by an &lt;a href=&#34;https://seninp.github.io/pubs#dunfield2007methane&#34;&gt;extremely acidophilic Verrucomicrobia bacterium&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Nature&lt;/em&gt;, 2007). On the temporal side: &lt;a href=&#34;https://seninp.github.io/pubs#senin2013sax&#34;&gt;SAX-VSM&lt;/a&gt; (with Sergey Malinchik at Lockheed Martin ATL) and &lt;a href=&#34;https://seninp.github.io/pubs#senin2018grammarviz&#34;&gt;GrammarViz 3.0&lt;/a&gt; (with US Army ERDC and academic collaborators, during my LANL postdoc). Code lives on &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/seninp&#34;&gt;GitHub&lt;/a&gt; — see &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/seninp/saxpy&#34;&gt;saxpy&lt;/a&gt; (Python), &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/jMotif/jmotif-R&#34;&gt;jmotif-R&lt;/a&gt; (R/C++), and the &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/GrammarViz2/grammarviz2_src&#34;&gt;GrammarViz 2.0 release&lt;/a&gt; (Java). Full publication list on &lt;a href=&#34;https://scholar.google.fr/citations?hl=en&amp;amp;user=pVTcEd8AAAAJ&#34;&gt;Google Scholar&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
